# INVWINTB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the Tags and
# Works filters of the search and of the item listing.  Items 1 and 3
# are tagged retro, item 1 ISA too.  Search > Filter items: F4 in Tags
# lists the tags in use and puts the one chosen in the field, and F4 in
# Works lists the states and Y?I, every item not known not to work;
# the results keep the items with every tag given and of those states,
# items 1 and 3; ESC opens the dialog again with both kept, and a second
# tag added by F4 leaves item 1 alone.  The item listing on the screen
# with Works N lists item 2 alone, and the dialog opened again for
# another run with Works on its empty row and the tag isa typed lists item 1.
# The end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINTB.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
# tags on items 1 and 3
K CTRL-E ALT-G
T retro ISA
K ENTER END CTRL-E ALT-G
T Retro
K ENTER
S TAGGED
# the filters: retro and Y?I chosen from their lists
K ALT-S F ALT-T F4
S TAGLIST
K END ENTER
S TAGGED1
K ALT-W F4
S WORKLIST
K END ENTER ENTER
S FOUND
K ESC
S AGAIN
K ALT-T F4 HOME ENTER
S BOTH
K ENTER
S ITEM1
K ESC ESC
# the item listing: Works N, then the tag isa alone
K ALT-R I ALT-W
T N
K ENTER
S LISTN
K ESC
S DIALOG
K ALT-W HOME ALT-G
T isa
K ENTER
S LISTISA
K ESC ESC ALT-F X
